  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Innovative Interventions for Older Adults</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Intervencion Innovadoras para el Adulto Mayor</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo del Programa sera mejorar la coordinacin, articulacin y coherencia, complementariedad, racionalidad, implementacin y evaluacin de la poltica, institucionalidad existente, oferta pblica de acciones, servicios y recursos de las distintas instancias e iniciativas pertinentes del Gobierno de Chile, dirigidos al adulto mayor.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the Program would be to improve coordination, articulation, coherence, complementarity, rationalization, implementation and evaluation of older adult policy, existing institutionality, public offering of actions, services and resources through the relevant organizations and initiatives of the Chilean Government, targeting older adults.</narrative>
  </description>
